o be appointed by me, to investigate the said disputes.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 1","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b6682af17ec378e47541df804","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-9793-creating-emergency-board-investigate-disputes-between-the-atlanta-st"},"scope_id":"EO:9793#p1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Each of the carriers involved shall be given independent consideration in such investigation, and the said labor organizations shall be permitted to function as a unit in proceedings before the board.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 2","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b6682af17ec378e47541df804","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-9793-creating-emergency-board-investigate-disputes-between-the-atlanta-st"},"scope_id":"EO:9793#p2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"No member of the said board shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of railway employees or any carrier.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 3","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b6682af17ec378e47541df804","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-9793-creating-emergency-board-investigate-disputes-between-the-atlanta-st"},"scope_id":"EO:9793#p3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"The board shall report its findings to the President with respect to the said disputes within thirty days from the date of this order. The report of the board shall contain separate and independent findings with respect to each of the carriers involved.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 4","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b6682af17ec378e47541df804","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-9793-creating-emergency-board-investigate-disputes-between-the-atlanta-st"},"scope_id":"EO:9793#p4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"As provided by section 10 of the Railway Labor Act, as amended, from this date and for thirty days after the board has made its report to the President, no change, except by agreement, shall be made by any of the carriers involved or their employees in the conditions out of which the said disputes arose.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 5","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b6682af17ec378e47541df804","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-9793-creating-emergency-board-investigate-disputes-between-the-atlanta-st"},"scope_id":"EO:9793#p5","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Atlanta & St. Andrews Bay Railway Company","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 278298; common-crawl capture 2025-12-05T05:07:45Z; unnumbered paragraph 6","sha256":"97d68b6fb0771b25ecb3837b8ece56359afdc42b66